# Steam shot 4: level 14 — the black-hole generation. The natural world has
# one at the centre (plus pulsars/comets/seekers and the mini-station); a
# composed one near the ship guarantees the lens is in frame.
size 1920 1080
seed 8
sim 1400
game 13
camera fixed
ship 0 -150 35
hold w 800
hold space 300
blackhole -420 280
asteroid 700 500 r=90 v=-35,-20
asteroid -850 -350 tough r=110 v=20,15
asteroid 600 -500 r=70 v=-25,20
